      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "The SQL query has been validated successfully.\n\nAquí tiene la consulta SQL para BigQuery, que calcula la distribución temporal por mes y año de los diagnósticos de nefropatía diabética, utilizando los Concept IDs aprobados `192279` y `4128221`:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM co.condition_start_date) AS diagnosis_year,\n    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM co.condition_start_date) AS diagnosis_month,\n    c.concept_name,\n    COUNT(co.condition_occurrence_id) AS number_of_diagnoses\nFROM\n    `condition_occurrence` AS co\nINNER JOIN\n    `concept` AS c\nON\n    co.condition_concept_id = c.concept_id\nWHERE\n    co.condition_concept_id IN (192279, 4128221)\nGROUP BY\n    diagnosis_year,\n    diagnosis_month,\n    c.concept_name\nORDER BY\n    diagnosis_year,\n    diagnosis_month,\n    c.concept_name;\n```\n"
          }
        ],
